OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA generally
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with some brightness
OL,7,Finitially further south. Outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain spreading east overnight, mainly
OL,9,Ffocused further north. Another rather
OL,10,Fmild night ahead with light winds
OL,11,Fthroughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA rather grey and damp day
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain and drizzle,
OL,15,Fwhich may turn heavier later in the
OL,16,Fday. Feeling rather humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
