OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fcooler and more changeable picture for
OL,7,Fthe middle of the week with a mix of
OL,8,Fbright spells and showers. The showers
OL,9,Fmost frequent and heaviest on
OL,10,FWednesday.
